[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m Immaculate beach                                                     Score: 0        Moves: 0      \u001b[19;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mTRISTAM ISLAND\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "By Hugo Labrande.\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 5 / Serial number 220830 / Inform v6.36 PunyInform v3.2\r\u001b[23dImmaculate beach\r\u001b[24dThis is the south side of the island you are now stuck on. The immensity of the Atlantic Ocean makes\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "you feel minuscule, a needle in a haystack, with no chance of being rescued. A steep hill covered by\u001b[26;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "a dense forest stands to the north; climbing it would likely take hours, and you don't really know\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "what you could find there, so you might as well explore your new home. The beach extends to the\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "northeast, where you can see a large boulder, and to the west.\r\u001b[30d>"]
