[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mEnd of th\u001b[94G"]
[0.000, "o", "1\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[mEnd of the beach\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "The beach on the south end of the island stops here; behind the large boulder, the coast turns into\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "steep rocks that form a small cove to the north. The rest of the beach extends southwest.\r\u001b[30d>"]
